      "heading": "say mı tell mi?",
      "body": "<p class=\"ex\"><b>say</b> + söz: She said “hello”. / He said that he was tired.<br><b>tell</b> + kişi: She <b>told me</b> the news. → Bana haberi anlattı.<br><span class=\"bad\">✘ She said me.</span> → ✔ She told me.</p>"
